WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.063
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:24.333 --> 00:26.240
You, the intern. You're coming with me.

3
00:26.240 --> 00:27.747
Help me carry the gift basket.

4
00:27.747 --> 00:30.600
But you have to come to tonight's party, Nant.

5
00:31.000 --> 00:33.700
It's not every day you run into your ex. Don't you want to catch up?

6
00:34.266 --> 00:35.366
What are you doing to my secretary?

7
00:35.700 --> 00:37.600
Do I seem completely worthless?

8
00:38.400 --> 00:40.266
One person might think you're worthless...

9
00:40.766 --> 00:43.933
but you might be the treasure another has been searching for.

10
00:56.066 --> 00:59.900
Bottoms up!

11
01:24.166 --> 01:25.600
I order...

12
01:27.200 --> 01:28.000
Number...

13
01:28.933 --> 01:29.733
Number...

14
01:41.866 --> 01:43.400
I order number two...

15
01:44.800 --> 01:45.600
Number two!

16
01:46.000 --> 01:46.600
Number two!

17
01:46.600 --> 01:47.366
Who's number two?

18
01:47.366 --> 01:48.321
Number two.

19
01:48.321 --> 01:50.333
No, not me.

20
01:51.400 --> 01:52.200
Hey,

21
01:52.366 --> 01:53.166
Nant,

22
01:53.700 --> 01:54.666
what are you doing?

23
01:54.900 --> 01:55.800
Don't tell me you're going to...

24
01:59.400 --> 02:01.527
I order number two

25
02:02.162 --> 02:03.866
to eat chocolate from my mouth.

26
02:04.469 --> 02:06.469
Whoa!

27
02:06.469 --> 02:07.719
Who's number two?

28
02:07.719 --> 02:09.026
Who's number two?

29
02:09.027 --> 02:11.027
Who's number two?

30
02:11.028 --> 02:12.278
No, It's not me.

31
02:19.500 --> 02:21.500
It's Boss again.

32
02:22.166 --> 02:22.966
A regular.

33
02:23.333 --> 02:24.133
Whoa!

34
02:24.166 --> 02:24.666
So drunk!

35
02:24.666 --> 02:26.000
Are you brave enough, Boss?

36
03:41.700 --> 03:43.700
Everything's spinning.

37
03:44.400 --> 03:45.733
Maybe the whole room really is spinning.

38
03:45.800 --> 03:46.300
Oh, really?

39
03:46.300 --> 03:46.800
Yeah, yeah.

40
03:48.133 --> 03:50.333
Come on, keep going! Finish it all!

41
03:51.100 --> 03:52.867
Wait, is the game over?

42
03:53.791 --> 03:57.133
Don't tell me Chat actually kissed her.

43
03:59.133 --> 04:00.266
Wow! Wow! Wow!

44
04:01.133 --> 04:01.933
Oh!

45
04:02.533 --> 04:05.733
Our boss has got serious guts.

46
04:06.266 --> 04:07.200
Good! Good!

47
04:07.500 --> 04:10.700
A real kiss. No stunt doubles.

48
04:18.333 --> 04:18.914
Uh...

49
04:20.000 --> 04:21.133
I'm going to the restroom.

50
04:27.566 --> 04:29.333
Here, drink up!

51
04:29.333 --> 04:30.955
Are you drunk yet?

52
04:31.475 --> 04:32.319
If not,

53
04:32.319 --> 04:33.920
drink until you are!

54
04:38.766 --> 04:42.300
Why is it so hot in here? Is the AC even on?

55
04:45.800 --> 04:49.800
Uh, I'll go to the restroom first.

56
04:57.847 --> 05:00.540
Cheers!

57
06:22.400 --> 06:23.704
Damn it, Theerachat.

58
06:24.974 --> 06:26.206
Get a grip.

59
06:27.187 --> 06:28.443
It's just a game.

60
06:29.309 --> 06:30.487
Yeah, yeah.

61
06:32.622 --> 06:33.919
It's just a game.

62
06:44.200 --> 06:45.000
Oh.

63
06:47.400 --> 06:49.200
So, how was kissing me?

64
06:52.466 --> 06:53.933
Was my lip sweet?

65
06:57.900 --> 07:00.100
Honestly, I didn't want to kiss you either.

66
07:01.300 --> 07:02.933
I don't know who you've kissed before.

67
07:07.333 --> 07:08.133
As for me...

68
07:09.300 --> 07:11.266
I don't go around kissing just anyone.

69
07:12.933 --> 07:13.733
I only...

70
07:16.000 --> 07:18.933
kiss people I actually want to kiss.

71
07:23.500 --> 07:24.866
Are you saying...

72
07:28.100 --> 07:29.858
I'm saying...

73
07:30.782 --> 07:33.133
I really wanted to kiss you, Boss.

74
07:43.800 --> 07:44.959
You're delusional.

75
07:46.633 --> 07:47.473
Move aside.

76
07:49.262 --> 07:50.133
I need to use the restroom.

77
08:05.066 --> 08:05.628
Hey, pretty.

78
08:06.552 --> 08:08.340
You're so drunk you can barely stand.

79
08:08.744 --> 08:09.700
Want me to walk you to your room?

80
08:09.866 --> 08:12.400
Oh, leave me alone! Get out of my way!

81
08:13.100 --> 08:14.318
Come with us.

82
08:14.549 --> 08:16.397
We've got plenty of fun things planned.

83
08:18.100 --> 08:19.366
I have a girlfriend, damn it!

84
08:21.600 --> 08:22.674
Where is she?

85
08:23.251 --> 08:24.566
I don't see anyone around here.

86
08:25.133 --> 08:29.566
That pretty lady over there? She's my girlfriend.

87
08:37.466 --> 08:39.600
Do you have a problem with my girl?

88
08:40.766 --> 08:41.621
No, miss.

89
08:41.621 --> 08:44.166
I think there's just been a little misunderstanding.

90
08:46.666 --> 08:48.109
Well, if you're done here,

91
08:48.571 --> 08:50.600
please step away from my girl.

92
09:02.900 --> 09:05.666
Whose girlfriend is this? So cute.

93
09:07.700 --> 09:10.766
Who's your girlfriend? Don't make things up.

94
09:16.566 --> 09:17.668
Do you know, Boss?

95
09:18.361 --> 09:20.359
You smell so nice.

96
09:25.700 --> 09:27.166
Let's get back.

97
09:37.900 --> 09:39.933
You're always getting yourself into trouble.

98
09:40.766 --> 09:42.466
How am I supposed to carry you home?

99
09:43.700 --> 09:45.066
You little brat.

100
09:47.166 --> 09:47.966
Come on.

101
09:48.500 --> 09:49.533
Let's go. Let's go.

102
09:57.900 --> 09:58.700
Hey.

103
10:00.200 --> 10:01.133
Are you really asleep?

104
10:02.133 --> 10:02.933
Ouch!

105
10:06.133 --> 10:08.500
Should we go somewhere else?

106
10:10.270 --> 10:10.827
I can't anymore.

107
10:10.827 --> 10:11.730
I can still go.

108
10:11.730 --> 10:12.287
Whoa, whoa!

109
10:12.691 --> 10:13.998
I'm just walking crooked.

110
10:14.682 --> 10:15.585
You're gonna fall!

111
10:16.020 --> 10:18.020
I have to take off my shoes and walk.

112
10:20.018 --> 10:20.979
Help!

113
10:20.980 --> 10:22.980
Should we keep partying?

114
10:23.333 --> 10:24.200
Wanna go somewhere else?

115
10:24.900 --> 10:25.900
Let's go home.

116
10:26.166 --> 10:27.266
Come on, let's keep going!

117
10:28.133 --> 10:28.933
Stand up straight.

118
10:30.356 --> 10:31.800
Hey!

119
10:31.800 --> 10:33.933
Who let this kid drink soju?

120
10:34.333 --> 10:36.366
She just kept chugging it. No one forced her.

121
10:39.700 --> 10:40.500
I guess...

122
10:42.000 --> 10:45.566
she wanted something to wash down her kisses.

123
10:50.400 --> 10:52.346
Should I just skip your bonus this year?

124
10:52.346 --> 10:52.900
No!

125
10:53.600 --> 10:54.400
Not good!

126
10:56.566 --> 10:58.566
Hey, stay still!

127
11:00.000 --> 11:01.300
You're so heavy.

128
11:02.100 --> 11:03.166
Stop leaning on me!

129
11:04.866 --> 11:05.666
Ouch.

130
11:06.133 --> 11:09.200
Boss, stop calling me so late at night.

131
11:10.500 --> 11:11.333
If you keep staying up this late,

132
11:12.166 --> 11:13.766
you'll never get a girlfriend!

133
11:19.600 --> 11:20.866
Just warning you. Boss.

134
11:21.566 --> 11:22.366
Ouch.

135
11:23.366 --> 11:24.166
What's so funny?

136
11:25.066 --> 11:25.866
Just you wait.

137
11:27.700 --> 11:28.500
Oh!

138
11:29.133 --> 11:29.933
Look!

139
11:30.200 --> 11:31.000
The car's here.

140
11:31.666 --> 11:32.666
Come on!

141
11:32.966 --> 11:33.900
Good night, Boss.

142
11:34.500 --> 11:36.200
You have to treat us again next time!

143
11:36.900 --> 11:37.800
Get home safely, everyone.

144
11:37.900 --> 11:38.933
Excuse me, coming through!

145
11:47.300 --> 11:50.679
Chat, I'll take Hanna home.

146
11:50.679 --> 11:52.166
She doesn't look like she can manage on her own.

147
11:53.766 --> 11:54.566
Take it slow.

148
11:55.066 --> 11:55.866
Goodbye.

149
11:56.133 --> 11:57.166
Don't call me.

150
11:57.500 --> 11:58.300
Yeah, I know.

151
11:58.333 --> 11:59.066
No, I don't want to work.

152
11:59.066 --> 11:59.566
Talk to me!

153
11:59.566 --> 12:02.333
(Hanna) No work, no work, no work! (Chat) Just take her.

154
12:02.366 --> 12:03.270
No call! No call!

155
12:03.270 --> 12:03.770
Get home safely.

156
12:04.717 --> 12:05.909
Ouch!

157
12:10.100 --> 12:10.900
Oh!

158
12:11.200 --> 12:13.266
Has everyone gone home already?

159
12:16.133 --> 12:16.933
Wait a minute.

160
12:17.300 --> 12:18.566
Were you pretending to be drunk?

161
12:21.700 --> 12:22.500
No.

162
12:23.333 --> 12:24.500
I wasn't pretending.

163
12:25.500 --> 12:27.500
I just wasn't that drunk.

164
12:28.800 --> 12:29.600
Come on.

165
12:30.133 --> 12:31.333
I'll take you home.

166
12:32.300 --> 12:34.366
And don't you dare try anything with me.

167
12:38.900 --> 12:41.400
I'm the one who should be saying that.

168
12:42.933 --> 12:46.333
Because you're the one who kissed me first, Boss.

169
12:46.800 --> 12:47.600
Did you already forget?

170
12:48.340 --> 12:52.360
Aha!

171
12:55.466 --> 12:57.657
Come on, the car's here.

172
12:58.407 --> 13:00.168
And don't throw up in my car.

173
13:00.457 --> 13:01.497
Got it?

174
13:05.826 --> 13:07.655
Roger that, Boss.

175
13:10.933 --> 13:11.733
Let's go.

176
13:11.866 --> 13:12.666
Time to head home.

177
13:13.933 --> 13:14.733
Let's go.

178
13:14.900 --> 13:16.400
Ouch! Stop leaning on me.

179
13:17.666 --> 13:18.466
Ow.

180
13:27.166 --> 13:28.466
Hurry up and get inside.

181
13:29.166 --> 13:30.300
I'm going to get some rest too.

182
13:36.666 --> 13:38.466
Aren't you coming upstairs to sleep with me, Boss?

183
13:41.766 --> 13:44.286
Why would I? I have my own condo.

184
13:44.286 --> 13:46.293
Why would I sleep with you?

185
13:46.928 --> 13:48.400
Hurry up and get to your room.

186
13:49.866 --> 13:50.666
Oh...

187
13:51.000 --> 13:54.566
And don't wear such revealing clothes to work again.

188
13:56.166 --> 13:57.100
It's annoying to look at.

189
13:57.500 --> 13:58.900
Are you annoyed, or are you jealous?

190
14:02.100 --> 14:02.900
Hmph?

191
14:03.849 --> 14:05.272
Annoyed.

192
14:08.133 --> 14:08.933
Okay.

193
14:10.600 --> 14:12.266
Go home and get some rest, Boss.

194
14:18.600 --> 14:20.700
Sweet dreams, baby.

195
14:35.000 --> 14:35.866
You little brat.

196
14:37.200 --> 14:38.000
How dare you?

197
14:42.500 --> 14:43.333
You're home late.

198
14:44.366 --> 14:46.100
Did you go to work with Boss Chat?

199
14:46.933 --> 14:48.366
How did you get into someone else's room?

200
14:48.700 --> 14:49.500
Get out!

201
14:51.166 --> 14:52.634
I'm not here to cause trouble.

202
14:53.384 --> 14:54.546
Just hear me out first.

203
14:55.700 --> 14:57.933
Don't make a scene this late at night.

204
15:00.933 --> 15:02.733
Whatever you have to say, spit it out.

205
15:03.900 --> 15:04.966
We've broken up.

206
15:05.200 --> 15:06.900
If anyone sees us, they'll get the wrong idea.

207
15:08.366 --> 15:10.400
By 'anyone', do you mean Boss Chat?

208
15:15.166 --> 15:15.966
Nant...

209
15:19.066 --> 15:20.500
I need a favor.

210
15:22.366 --> 15:25.400
Could you put in a good word for me with my boss?

211
15:26.333 --> 15:28.300
This new project means a lot to me.

212
15:31.400 --> 15:32.200
Please.

213
15:35.200 --> 15:36.533
What's your boss's name?

214
15:37.533 --> 15:38.333
What's her name again?

215
15:41.733 --> 15:42.875
Well...

216
15:44.029 --> 15:45.084
Her name is Orn.

217
15:45.084 --> 15:46.925
You've got some nerve.

218
15:46.925 --> 15:51.300
You want me to put in a good word with the person you left me for?

219
15:52.066 --> 15:53.266
Get your priorities straight, Nant.

220
15:53.700 --> 15:54.500
Business is business.

221
15:55.133 --> 15:56.300
It's you who need to get your priorities straight.

222
15:56.533 --> 15:58.653
You shameless jerk! Get out!

223
15:58.653 --> 15:59.266
No!

224
15:59.533 --> 16:00.125
Get out!

225
16:00.125 --> 16:00.625
No!

226
16:01.000 --> 16:01.800
Ouch!

227
16:12.666 --> 16:15.100
Did you leave this here to tempt me?

228
16:18.100 --> 16:20.766
Wait here. I'll be right back.

229
16:23.900 --> 16:26.966
You're just a secretary, but you acts like the boss's wife.

230
16:32.400 --> 16:34.100
Behave yourself, sweetheart.

231
16:35.700 --> 16:37.800
Maybe I'll change my mind and take you back.

232
16:38.700 --> 16:39.500
So full of yourself.

233
16:40.200 --> 16:41.000
Get out!

234
16:41.900 --> 16:42.700
Ouch!

235
16:43.533 --> 16:44.333
Get out!

236
16:52.566 --> 16:53.366
What's going on?

237
16:54.300 --> 16:56.700
Boss, what are you doing here?

238
17:07.366 --> 17:10.466
I asked what you did to my girl.

239
17:13.100 --> 17:13.900
Nothing, really.

240
17:15.066 --> 17:16.133
We were just talking.

241
17:16.666 --> 17:17.466
Just talking?

242
17:18.333 --> 17:20.300
Then why was she on the floor?

243
17:21.066 --> 17:21.866
Get out.

244
17:28.400 --> 17:29.200
Are you okay?

245
17:30.366 --> 17:31.166
Take it slow.

246
17:51.100 --> 17:53.933
Are you hurt? Does anything hurt?

247
17:59.533 --> 18:00.333
I'm used to it.

248
18:02.333 --> 18:03.133
Used to it?

249
18:16.400 --> 18:17.766
Boss, what are you doing?

250
18:21.266 --> 18:24.190
Uh, I'm blowing on your wound to make it better.

251
18:25.518 --> 18:26.697
Doesn't it hurt?

252
18:38.900 --> 18:40.500
Boss, do you want to kiss me?

253
18:51.766 --> 18:52.666
Uh... Uh...

254
18:53.166 --> 18:54.700
Your ex has already left.

255
18:55.133 --> 18:55.933
And I...

256
18:56.300 --> 18:57.567
I'll be leaving soon too.

257
18:57.567 --> 18:58.677
Wait.

258
19:00.800 --> 19:02.000
You haven't answered my question.

259
19:03.466 --> 19:04.566
Do you want to kiss me?

260
19:14.400 --> 19:15.200
No.

261
19:17.266 --> 19:21.333
Or would you rather see me in my pajamas?

262
19:32.933 --> 19:35.333
I don't want to see that. I'm leaving.

263
19:38.066 --> 19:38.866
Well...

264
19:39.333 --> 19:41.200
And don't forget to lock your door properly.

265
19:41.800 --> 19:42.600
Your phone.

266
19:42.700 --> 19:43.733
You left it in my car.

267
20:06.300 --> 20:08.000
Should we head back to the condo, Boss?

268
20:10.266 --> 20:10.912
Not yet.

269
20:11.489 --> 20:13.070
I'm staying here tonight.

270
20:13.763 --> 20:15.266
We'll park here and keep watch.

271
20:15.700 --> 20:17.500
Huh? Keep watch over whom, Boss?

272
20:19.000 --> 20:20.900
Stop asking so many questions.

273
20:21.766 --> 20:25.200
Oh, and go get me a coffee.

274
20:25.866 --> 20:27.133
Get one for yourself too.

275
20:28.733 --> 20:29.700
It's going to be a long night.

276
20:40.366 --> 20:41.166
Is that Nant's message?

277
20:53.600 --> 20:54.500
Not again...

278
20:59.700 --> 21:00.500
Why did you send that?

279
21:02.000 --> 21:03.800
It's not like I wanted to see it.

280
21:05.333 --> 21:06.133
Ow!

281
21:06.466 --> 21:08.266
Get a hold of yourself, Theerachat.

282
21:13.100 --> 21:14.300
She's ridiculously gorgeous.

283
21:20.933 --> 21:21.733
Ow!

284
21:24.900 --> 21:29.066
I'm only saving this picture so I can blackmail you later.

285
21:39.266 --> 21:40.200
Damn it!

286
22:03.066 --> 22:03.866
Nant...

287
22:04.866 --> 22:05.666
Um...

288
22:05.900 --> 22:07.566
I don't mean to pry, but...

289
22:08.600 --> 22:11.133
I need you to give me the whole truth.

290
22:12.066 --> 22:14.966
So, did you and Boss actually...

291
22:18.700 --> 22:20.000
Did you two really kiss?

292
22:21.266 --> 22:22.666
What kiss? Nothing happened!

293
22:23.000 --> 22:24.933
I was sitting right there!

294
22:25.533 --> 22:27.200
You were way too drunk to be a reliable witness.

295
22:27.666 --> 22:28.466
Just tell us.

296
22:28.466 --> 22:30.400
Yeah, you were completely wasted.

297
22:34.566 --> 22:35.400
Oh!

298
22:37.900 --> 22:40.566
I was really drunk last night.

299
22:41.366 --> 22:42.166
Uh...

300
22:42.500 --> 22:45.400
I blacked out. I don't remember a thing.

301
22:46.666 --> 22:48.066
Hanna doesn't remember either.

302
22:48.733 --> 22:49.966
Nant doesn't remember.

303
22:51.733 --> 22:53.933
Maybe nothing actually happened?

304
22:55.566 --> 22:56.866
Maybe that's true.

305
22:57.400 --> 22:58.500
Because someone like Boss...

306
22:58.700 --> 22:59.966
She's too lazy to even smile.

307
23:00.066 --> 23:01.166
So I doubt she'd actually kiss someone.

308
23:07.733 --> 23:08.566
What are you talking about?

309
23:09.028 --> 23:10.800
I could hear you all the way from the elevator.

310
23:11.600 --> 23:13.800
Nothing, Boss. Absolutely nothing.

311
23:15.066 --> 23:17.166
Then get back to work.

312
23:18.366 --> 23:19.166
Okay, okay.

313
23:38.400 --> 23:39.600
Do you really not remember?

314
23:42.966 --> 23:45.200
Last night, you said you wanted to kiss me.

315
23:46.066 --> 23:47.700
But now you suddenly don't remember?

316
23:53.466 --> 23:54.556
How cruel.

317
23:55.422 --> 23:56.300
Thitinant.

318
24:04.500 --> 24:05.300
Whoa!

319
24:06.100 --> 24:07.166
I thought she was going to kiss me.

320
24:30.866 --> 24:32.400
You've got a lot of mosquito bites.

321
24:33.533 --> 24:35.333
Who were you keeping watch over last night?

322
24:36.700 --> 24:37.500
Keeping watch?

323
24:38.000 --> 24:38.800
Who was keeping watch?

324
24:39.700 --> 24:41.666
You think someone like me would actually stay up watching over you?

325
24:43.066 --> 24:43.866
What?

326
24:44.700 --> 24:46.800
I never said you were watching over me.

327
24:47.700 --> 24:48.733
You're awfully defensive, Boss.

328
24:55.266 --> 24:56.566
I'm jealous of those mosquitoes.

329
24:58.700 --> 25:00.200
They even got to bite your neck.

330
25:03.200 --> 25:05.666
You've been bitting at me nonstop yourself.

331
25:06.000 --> 25:06.626
You...

332
25:06.626 --> 25:08.733
You're even worse than a mosquito.

333
25:11.133 --> 25:12.066
Me?

334
25:13.366 --> 25:14.166
Mm-hmm.

335
25:15.300 --> 25:16.100
You are.

336
25:17.000 --> 25:17.800
Oh!

337
25:17.966 --> 25:19.000
Hey! Uh...

338
25:19.500 --> 25:20.300
Does it hurt?

339
25:20.733 --> 25:21.700
Sorry, sorry.

340
25:22.333 --> 25:23.133
Let me see.

341
25:23.733 --> 25:24.533
Where does it hurt?

342
25:26.066 --> 25:28.066
Boss, the client requested some revisions...

343
25:28.366 --> 25:28.898
Ouch!

344
25:30.283 --> 25:31.667
Is this the work you've done?

345
25:31.667 --> 25:32.536
This is so sloppy!

346
25:32.536 --> 25:35.500
Didn't I tell you to check everything

347
25:35.500 --> 25:37.866
before it gets to me? Do you want to get fired?

348
25:38.233 --> 25:39.540
Wait, wait!

349
25:40.766 --> 25:41.566
Boss.

350
25:42.133 --> 25:43.166
Please calm down.

351
25:43.600 --> 25:44.500
Secretary Han!

352
25:44.766 --> 25:45.266
Yes?

353
25:45.266 --> 25:45.766
Get out!

354
25:46.066 --> 25:48.733
And don't enter my office without permission.

355
25:49.366 --> 25:49.866
Whoa!

356
25:49.866 --> 25:50.366
Hey!

357
25:50.900 --> 25:52.133
Uh, yes, Boss.

358
25:53.700 --> 25:54.887
Are you asking for trouble?

359
25:54.887 --> 25:55.469
Oh!

360
25:55.469 --> 25:55.969
Get out!

361
25:55.969 --> 25:56.566
Yes, Boss.

362
25:56.766 --> 25:57.600
Please calm down!

363
26:14.166 --> 26:14.966
Ouch!

364
26:18.300 --> 26:18.800
Uh...

365
26:19.493 --> 26:23.733
I think... I think my skirt just ripped.

366
26:23.866 --> 26:25.450
Oh, uh...

367
26:25.450 --> 26:28.900
Wait, wait. Sit down first. Don't move.

368
26:39.766 --> 26:41.799
I happen to have a spare in the cabinet.

369
26:41.799 --> 26:44.964
It might be a little loose on you since it's my size, but...

370
26:45.368 --> 26:47.137
You can wear it for now.

371
26:48.200 --> 26:49.500
Thank you.

372
26:50.800 --> 26:52.266
Change in here.

373
26:52.666 --> 26:53.966
I'll wait outside.

374
26:55.566 --> 26:56.366
Hey!

375
26:58.333 --> 27:00.933
You're really going to leave me like this, Boss?

376
27:02.133 --> 27:04.266
You haven't even checked

377
27:06.400 --> 27:08.133
whether it actually fits me.

378
27:12.000 --> 27:15.333
Just put it on. It's better than the ripped one.

379
27:31.900 --> 27:33.600
I'm about to put on the skirt now.

380
27:57.733 --> 27:59.266
I'm pulling it up now.

381
28:16.041 --> 28:18.041
I'm about to take the old one off.

382
28:24.133 --> 28:26.600
Boss, could you unzip my old skirt for me?

383
28:46.566 --> 28:48.200
I've already unzipped your skirt.

384
28:53.166 --> 28:55.500
I'm slowly taking it off now.

385
28:59.200 --> 29:00.000
You can take it off.

386
29:26.333 --> 29:30.733
Thank you, Ms. Chat, for taking my skirt off for me.

387
29:50.500 --> 29:51.300
Sorry.

388
30:01.733 --> 30:03.300
Do you like me yet, Boss?

389
30:09.600 --> 30:10.400
Uh...

390
30:10.966 --> 30:12.100
Who would ever like you?

391
30:41.100 --> 30:42.533
You really don't like me?

392
31:25.700 --> 31:26.500
Uh...

393
31:28.100 --> 31:28.900
I...

394
31:31.133 --> 31:32.533
I...

395
31:33.166 --> 31:34.533
Uh, I...

396
32:07.466 --> 32:09.133
I'm... I'm done putting on the skirt.

397
32:09.966 --> 32:11.400
I'll head outside now.

398
32:14.700 --> 32:15.500
Wait.

399
32:17.700 --> 32:18.500
Uh...

400
32:18.800 --> 32:19.966
Your old skirt...

401
32:20.366 --> 32:22.300
If you're not wearing it anymore, don't leave it in my office.

402
32:22.500 --> 32:24.066
Someone might find it and get the wrong idea.

403
32:25.166 --> 32:26.400
Uh, yeah, yeah.

404
32:27.066 --> 32:27.866
Keep it with you.

405
32:28.133 --> 32:29.366
Okay, uh...

406
32:29.700 --> 32:30.500
Thank you.

407
32:45.866 --> 32:47.466
I've already unzipped your skirt.

408
33:12.666 --> 33:13.812
Uh...

409
33:14.909 --> 33:16.424
Nant, is something wrong?

410
33:17.002 --> 33:19.484
Why is your face so red?

411
33:20.234 --> 33:22.866
Did Boss really hit you?

412
33:24.333 --> 33:25.133
Uh...

413
33:25.533 --> 33:26.333
I...

414
33:26.466 --> 33:27.600
I... I'm fine.

415
33:28.200 --> 33:29.400
How could you be fine?

416
33:30.300 --> 33:32.066
Look at your cheeks! Goodness!

417
33:32.300 --> 33:33.100
Oh, Nant...

418
33:33.500 --> 33:34.900
You look like a total mess

419
33:35.766 --> 33:36.566
Nant...

420
33:38.400 --> 33:40.100
Boss didn't hit me!

421
33:41.000 --> 33:43.266
Boss didn't do anything rough to me.

422
33:44.166 --> 33:45.766
Your face is really red, though.

423
33:46.000 --> 33:47.200
Don't you have work to do?

424
33:49.300 --> 33:51.366
The company pays you to work,

425
33:52.266 --> 33:53.700
not to sit around gossiping.

426
33:54.866 --> 33:56.366
Oh! It's upside down.

427
33:57.333 --> 33:58.466
Som, wait...

428
34:00.000 --> 34:02.011
Sure, just like that.

429
34:02.011 --> 34:02.566
Oh, okay.

430
34:14.466 --> 34:15.500
Ms. Chat?

431
34:16.666 --> 34:18.166
Are you feeling alright?

432
34:18.566 --> 34:20.766
Why is your face so red?

433
34:23.066 --> 34:25.400
Secretary Han, get back to work.

434
34:45.300 --> 34:49.200
Do you think Boss is scarier than usual today?

435
34:49.400 --> 34:51.133
Totally. I'm never inviting her out again.

436
34:51.600 --> 34:52.866
Yeah, she's terrifying.

437
35:00.600 --> 35:01.597
Wait a minute.

438
35:02.290 --> 35:03.958
Let me get my thoughts straight.

439
35:03.958 --> 35:06.935
So, you kissed an intern...

440
35:06.935 --> 35:11.400
And that intern is the same girl who ruined your wedding?

441
35:14.200 --> 35:16.000
Well, she was the one who came onto me first.

442
35:17.800 --> 35:19.053
That's not even the point!

443
35:19.053 --> 35:22.133
The point is, you kissed her back, Chat!

444
35:23.100 --> 35:27.335
Right? Normally, if a hot, built guy takes his shirt off to tease you...

445
35:27.335 --> 35:29.066
you don't even bat an eye.

446
35:29.533 --> 35:31.105
But this time, one little intern

447
35:31.105 --> 35:33.000
has you completely flustered?

448
35:33.533 --> 35:35.800
I told you, I didn't mean to!

449
35:37.700 --> 35:38.766
It just happened in the moment.

450
35:39.600 --> 35:40.766
It was self-defense.

451
35:41.300 --> 35:43.266
Right. Self-defense.

452
35:44.533 --> 35:46.766
You defended yourself by kissing her?

453
35:48.333 --> 35:49.133
Oh, come on!

454
35:49.400 --> 35:50.800
Can you stop pushing my buttons?

455
35:51.300 --> 35:52.400
I'm confused myself.

456
35:54.900 --> 35:55.966
Can I ask you something straight up?

457
35:56.533 --> 35:57.566
How do you feel about her?

458
36:01.566 --> 36:04.200
It wasn't bad.

459
36:07.566 --> 36:12.166
I mean... It's not like I felt anything special.

460
36:13.466 --> 36:16.037
Oh, okay. I got it.

461
36:16.037 --> 36:17.966
I get it now.

462
36:18.533 --> 36:19.400
Get what?

463
36:20.533 --> 36:21.575
Nothing.

464
36:21.575 --> 36:24.182
But I can barely remember what she looks like now.

465
36:24.182 --> 36:25.366
Got a picture? Let me see.

466
36:26.500 --> 36:27.600
Why do you want to see it?

467
36:28.266 --> 36:29.066
I'm not showing you.

468
36:29.333 --> 36:30.133
Wait a minute.

469
36:30.466 --> 36:32.000
You're being awfully protective.

470
36:33.400 --> 36:36.366
Don't tell me you like that girl.

471
36:36.766 --> 36:37.665
Are you crazy?

472
36:38.646 --> 36:39.566
I don't like her!

473
36:40.366 --> 36:43.466
The quicker you deny it, the more suspicious you look.

474
36:44.333 --> 36:47.700
Honestly, your taste has definitely changed.

475
36:48.933 --> 36:49.733
How so?

476
36:53.166 --> 36:54.766
You know, like shifting your type to someone like her.

477
36:56.366 --> 36:57.166
Huh?

478
36:58.366 --> 36:59.466
No, no, no.

479
37:00.066 --> 37:00.866
That's not true.

480
37:01.866 --> 37:02.733
I don't like her.

481
37:03.500 --> 37:06.700
Do you really not like her, or do you just not know how you feel?

482
37:14.200 --> 37:15.466
So what am I supposed to do?

483
37:16.166 --> 37:16.891
Easy.

484
37:17.411 --> 37:19.113
Try kissing another woman.

485
37:19.113 --> 37:21.602
If you feel the same spark when you kiss her,

486
37:21.602 --> 37:23.548
then you just like women in general.

487
37:23.548 --> 37:24.866
That girl isn't anything special.

488
37:36.466 --> 37:40.100
Fine. I'll try it. Let's get this over with.

489
37:45.100 --> 37:45.900
Excuse me!

490
37:52.066 --> 37:53.822
I've got someone for you.

491
37:53.822 --> 37:57.161
She's got exactly the same vibe, though maybe a different feel.

492
37:57.161 --> 37:58.597
And if she's not your type,

493
37:58.597 --> 38:02.123
there are plenty more over there. Give them a try!

494
38:02.123 --> 38:03.173
Let's settle this once and for all.

495
38:04.212 --> 38:06.766
Have a seat right here.

496
38:11.166 --> 38:12.768
Tonight, let me

497
38:12.768 --> 38:14.320
take care of you, Boss.

498
38:14.955 --> 38:18.935
I promise you won't feel lonely.

499
38:33.266 --> 38:34.766
Am I not taking good enough care of you?

500
38:36.900 --> 38:38.336
Then...

501
38:39.202 --> 38:42.400
Let me make you feel even better.

502
38:47.700 --> 38:49.366
I'm about to put on the skirt now.

503
38:58.000 --> 39:01.366
Ms. Chat, you smell so nice.

504
39:04.166 --> 39:07.166
Do you know, Boss? You smell so nice.

505
39:10.600 --> 39:11.566
Ms. Chat...

506
39:13.266 --> 39:14.466
I really like you.

507
39:15.500 --> 39:16.533
I want you to come back again.

508
39:18.066 --> 39:18.866
Would you?

509
39:20.800 --> 39:21.600
Please?

510
39:23.900 --> 39:25.466
Do you like me yet, Boss?

511
39:33.566 --> 39:34.366
No.

512
39:38.000 --> 39:40.266
I'm sorry, but I'm not okay with this.

513
39:41.966 --> 39:43.002
Wait, Chat.

514
39:43.002 --> 39:44.684
If she's not the one, that's okay.

515
39:44.684 --> 39:46.500
I'll find someone else for you.

516
39:48.500 --> 39:49.300
Forget it.

517
39:50.766 --> 39:53.800
Hey, wait! Where are you going, Chat?

518
39:59.300 --> 40:00.421
She's got it bad.

519
40:00.710 --> 40:02.708
Really bad.

520
40:02.708 --> 40:03.626
But...

521
40:04.838 --> 40:09.053
I think we should start looking for wedding dresses.

522
40:09.573 --> 40:11.005
One hundred percent.

523
40:29.455 --> 40:30.600
What the hell is wrong with you, Theerachat?

524
40:31.235 --> 40:32.911
Why did I drive all the way here?

525
40:56.566 --> 40:57.700
Secretary Han.

526
40:58.400 --> 41:01.666
Reschedule the vineyard meeting for tomorrow.

527
41:02.866 --> 41:05.200
Check with Mr. Warayut first to see if he's available.

528
41:06.659 --> 41:08.659
(Reschedule the vineyard meeting for tomorrow.)

529
41:08.659 --> 41:10.659
(Check with Mr. Warayut first to see if he's available.)

530
41:14.366 --> 41:21.366
Vineyard tomorrow. Be outside your dorm at 6 AM sharp.

531
41:21.879 --> 41:24.514
Don't be late.

532
41:27.421 --> 41:28.671
Hmm...

533
41:32.166 --> 41:33.900
I wonder if that girl's complaining about me already.

534
41:38.061 --> 41:39.080
Whatever.

535
41:40.001 --> 41:44.599
Out-of-town trip tomorrow, 2 nights. 6 AM sharp outside your building.

536
42:09.966 --> 42:11.400
It's 9:30 already.

537
42:33.533 --> 42:36.047
You said 6 AM. No delays, no being late.

538
42:36.047 --> 42:38.466
But it's already 9:30, Boss.

539
42:41.066 --> 42:43.033
Are you doing this on purpose just to mess with me?

540
42:43.033 --> 42:44.933
Leave me standing out here in the burning sun like this?

541
42:47.466 --> 42:48.604
I'm your boss,

542
42:48.604 --> 42:51.235
and you're just my subordinate.

543
42:51.235 --> 42:54.455
My schedule is flexible.

544
42:54.455 --> 42:58.566
Your job is to wait.

545
43:02.200 --> 43:03.000
You're so mean.

546
43:09.600 --> 43:10.666
I bought this for you.

547
43:16.066 --> 43:16.866
Here, take it.

548
43:18.933 --> 43:20.423
Boss, you didn't...

549
43:20.423 --> 43:23.100
secretly slip laxatives or poison in this, did you?

550
43:26.166 --> 43:27.272
What's wrong with you?

551
43:27.561 --> 43:30.166
Do you really think I'm that crazy?

552
43:30.500 --> 43:31.260
Yes.

553
43:32.010 --> 43:35.666
Because someone like you is absolutely impossible to trust.

554
43:44.711 --> 43:46.018
But...

555
43:46.933 --> 43:47.943
Still...

556
43:48.867 --> 43:51.053
Th...Thank you.

557
44:14.866 --> 44:17.500
Hey, let me ask you something.

558
44:20.800 --> 44:23.466
If I were a cup of coffee,

559
44:24.166 --> 44:25.533
what kind would I be?

560
44:28.966 --> 44:31.266
Don't try to make small talk to change the subject, Boss.

561
44:31.566 --> 44:33.533
You think this makes up for being late?

562
44:35.666 --> 44:37.733
I'm just curious about how my subordinate sees me.

563
44:38.133 --> 44:39.200
Come on, just answer.

564
44:43.200 --> 44:45.800
If I had to compare you to coffee...

565
44:50.333 --> 44:51.800
Maybe an Americano.

566
44:54.466 --> 44:55.266
Why?

567
44:55.966 --> 44:57.666
Because I'm composed,

568
44:58.266 --> 44:59.066
smooth,

569
44:59.766 --> 45:02.400
classic, mature, and cool like that?

570
45:02.700 --> 45:03.766
Nope.

571
45:04.500 --> 45:05.300
Bitter.

572
45:05.366 --> 45:06.166
Hard to swallow.

573
45:07.066 --> 45:08.566
Just like your personality right now.

574
45:11.600 --> 45:13.100
Look at you, all sassy and sarcastic.

575
45:13.766 --> 45:15.300
And you've got quite a sharp tongue.

576
45:19.400 --> 45:23.400
But honestly, this cup of coffee is actually pretty good.

577
45:26.600 --> 45:29.082
I guess the barista knew

578
45:29.082 --> 45:31.059
how bitter the person ordering it was.

579
45:31.059 --> 45:33.466
So they secretly added a little syrup.

580
45:34.366 --> 45:36.366
Come on. Get in the car.

581
45:40.566 --> 45:41.666
Thitinant.

582
45:41.792 --> 45:43.215
Wait a second.

583
45:48.866 --> 45:51.558
You're not sitting in the back.

584
45:51.558 --> 45:53.648
I'm not your driver.

585
45:53.648 --> 45:54.400
Sit beside me.

586
45:58.566 --> 46:01.400
Thitinant Inganant, walk faster.

587
46:15.328 --> 46:17.466
(Warning: Contains a simulated pelvic exam. Viewer discretion advised.)

588
46:17.466 --> 46:18.786
Why is the AC so damn cold?

589
46:18.786 --> 46:19.966
I've got goosebumps all over.

590
46:23.100 --> 46:25.414
Hello, Ms. Kirin.

591
46:25.414 --> 46:28.656
You have a pelvic exam and cervical cancer screening today, along with...

592
46:29.464 --> 46:31.797
your first HPV vaccine shot.

593
46:34.666 --> 46:37.300
Hey! It's that Ham-and-Cheese doctor!

594
46:38.200 --> 46:38.934
Who's that?

595
46:39.223 --> 46:41.700
I'm a doctor, honey. Dr. Airaya.

596
46:43.200 --> 46:44.466
What a ridiculously small world.

597
46:45.066 --> 46:46.800
There are hundreds of OB-GYN in Bangkok,

598
46:47.400 --> 46:48.766
and I have to run into this woman?

599
46:49.066 --> 46:50.442
I don't know if the world is just that small

600
46:50.904 --> 46:53.100
or if karma really does travel fast.

601
46:54.400 --> 46:55.855
At 21 years old,

602
46:55.855 --> 46:59.500
you're here for an internal examination and your first HPV vaccine.

603
47:00.600 --> 47:03.000
That's very responsible of you.

604
47:03.766 --> 47:07.266
Even if your public manners are a little lacking.

605
47:07.800 --> 47:08.600
Hey, Doc.

606
47:09.300 --> 47:10.400
Was that an insult?

607
47:11.000 --> 47:12.100
I wasn't insulting you.

608
47:12.466 --> 47:13.466
I was simply complimenting you.

609
47:14.333 --> 47:15.466
Now, stop talking and

610
47:15.600 --> 47:17.200
get on the examination table.

611
47:17.400 --> 47:19.066
You're wasting the next patient's time.

612
47:20.700 --> 47:21.533
I'm not getting examined!

613
47:22.500 --> 47:25.166
Nurse, can I switch doctors?

614
47:25.733 --> 47:27.700
This doctor seems extremely untrustworthy.

615
47:28.200 --> 47:29.000
Uh...

616
47:29.366 --> 47:32.200
All the other doctors are fully booked until next month.

617
47:36.400 --> 47:37.499
Did you hear that?

618
47:37.499 --> 47:40.766
If you don't get examined today, you can just grab your things and go home.

619
47:42.066 --> 47:45.126
Oh, but you've already paid the doctor's fee.

620
47:45.126 --> 47:46.600
What a waste that would be.

621
47:48.333 --> 47:49.133
Please, go ahead.

622
48:10.566 --> 48:11.704
Hello, Ms. Chat.

623
48:11.704 --> 48:16.733
It's only been six months, but you're so stunning I barely recognized you.

624
48:19.566 --> 48:20.666
Hello, Mr. Yut.

625
48:21.200 --> 48:23.066
You still look as handsome as ever.

626
48:25.500 --> 48:26.300
Thank you.

627
48:31.400 --> 48:33.200
Shall we go inside and talk?

628
48:33.900 --> 48:34.866
It's quite hot out here.

629
48:35.166 --> 48:37.666
I'm just worried Ms. Chat's skin might get sunburned.

630
48:38.100 --> 48:40.000
Uh, is she your new secretary?

631
48:41.066 --> 48:44.666
Uh, she looks dressed for action.

632
48:46.666 --> 48:47.800
She's just an intern.

633
48:48.166 --> 48:49.248
Hmm.

634
48:49.248 --> 48:50.253
Mr. Yut, please don't mind her.

635
48:50.253 --> 48:51.400
Hmm.

636
48:51.400 --> 48:53.000
Let's talk about the deal instead.

637
48:53.733 --> 48:56.739
Well, let's put business aside for now.

638
48:56.739 --> 48:58.735
I'd like to take you, Ms. Chat,

639
48:59.139 --> 49:00.922
on a tour of the vineyard's new section.

640
49:00.922 --> 49:04.066
Just the two of us, perhaps?

641
49:04.066 --> 49:04.866
That won't be necessary!

642
49:06.774 --> 49:07.620
Oh!

643
49:11.600 --> 49:15.091
I mean, I'm her secretary.

644
49:15.091 --> 49:17.500
She has all the documents with me.

645
49:19.600 --> 49:21.600
There's no need to trouble

646
49:22.066 --> 49:23.066
the intern like this.

647
49:23.733 --> 49:25.066
I'm right here.

648
49:25.533 --> 49:27.533
I can answer all your questions.

649
49:28.333 --> 49:29.333
It's no trouble at all.

650
49:29.966 --> 49:31.166
I'm her secretary, after all.

651
49:31.566 --> 49:34.700
I'll still need to take notes for Ms. Chat anyway.

652
49:37.566 --> 49:38.366
Nant.

653
49:39.666 --> 49:40.466
Nant.

